<DATA=Code>
  2009-01-01 12:00  => IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* SSG-4 (MT-069): one EXTEUR for every call. Record length,
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* currency field, target and amounts come from the SGSPARM
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* file written by the skeleton hand-off (the hand-off reads the
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* phase in EU001, spec A1/A2); behaviour: Generic/EXTEUR/spec.md.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PROGRAM-ID. 'EXTEUR-GN'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => CONFIGURATION SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => SOURCE-COMPUTER. UNIVAC-1100-10.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => OBJECT-COMPUTER. UNIVAC-1100-10.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => SPECIAL-NAMES.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FILE-CONTROL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT PARMF ASSIGN TO DISC SGSPARM.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT FI1 ASSIGN TO DISC EXTIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT FO1 ASSIGN TO DISC EXTOUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT FO2 ASSIGN TO DISC EXTANO.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => DATA DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FILE SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  PARMF
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     LABEL RECORD STANDARD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  PARM-REC.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  P-TYPE         PIC XX.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  P-POS          PIC 9(5).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  P-LEN          PIC 9(5).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  P-DLEN         PIC 9(5).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  P-TARGET       PIC X(3).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  P-PHA          PIC X(3).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  P-C1           PIC X(3).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  P-C2           PIC X(3).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC X(51).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  FI1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     LABEL RECORD STANDARD
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     RECORD VARYING IN SIZE FROM 1 TO 4001
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DEPENDING ON WS-IN-LEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  FI1-REC PIC X(4001).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  FO1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     LABEL RECORD STANDARD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  FO1-REC PIC X(4000).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  FO2
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     LABEL RECORD STANDARD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  FO2-REC PIC X(4000).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  RECIN              PIC X(4001).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-IN              PIC X(4001).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-OUT             PIC X(4000).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  WS-IN-LEN          PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  CP-LEN             PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-LONG             PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  D-POS              PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  D-LEN              PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  N-MT               PIC 9(3) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  I                  PIC 9(3) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  K                  PIC 9(3) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  L                  PIC 9(3) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  AP                 PIC 9(3) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  FPOS               PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  NDIG               PIC 9(3) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  SW-END             PIC 9 VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  SW-ERREUR          PIC 9 VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  WS-MAJ             PIC 9 VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  WS-NEG             PIC 9 VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  WS-FORM            PIC X VALUE SPACE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  WS-D               PIC 9 VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-TARGET          PIC X(3).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-PHA             PIC X(3).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-C1              PIC X(3).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-C2              PIC X(3).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-OWN             PIC X(3).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-DEV             PIC X(3).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* counters as the skeleton (MAJ: no VALUE there, spec A5)
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-NB-REC-LUS      PIC 9(10) VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-NB-REC-MAJ      PIC 9(10) VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-NB-REC-ERR      PIC 9(8) VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  MT-TAB.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  MT-ENT OCCURS 50.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  MT-POS     PIC 9(5) COMP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  MT-LEN     PIC 9(5) COMP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* an amount field, left-aligned (its own length L)
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-FLD             PIC X(18).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-FC              PIC X.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-LC              PIC X.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* digits right-aligned with leading zeros
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-NUM             PIC 9(18).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-NUM-X REDEFINES WS-NUM PIC X(18).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-VAL             PIC S9(18).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-RES             PIC S9(18).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-LIM             PIC 9(18).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-OVP             PIC X(10) VALUE '{ABCDEFGHI'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-OVN             PIC X(10) VALUE '}JKLMNOPQR'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PROCEDURE DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => DEBUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     OPEN INPUT PARMF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PARM-LECT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     READ PARMF AT END GO TO PARM-FIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF P-TYPE = 'HD'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-POS TO P-LONG
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-LEN TO D-POS
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-DLEN TO D-LEN
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-TARGET TO WS-TARGET
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-PHA TO WS-PHA
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-C1 TO WS-C1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-C2 TO WS-C2.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF P-TYPE = 'MT'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        ADD 1 TO N-MT
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-POS TO MT-POS (N-MT)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-LEN TO MT-LEN (N-MT).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO PARM-LECT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PARM-FIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CLOSE PARMF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-C2 TO WS-OWN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-TARGET = 'BEF'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE WS-C1 TO WS-OWN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     OPEN OUTPUT FO2 FO1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     OPEN INPUT FI1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY 'PHASE ACTUELLE : ' WS-PHA '/' WS-TARGET.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => LECT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO RECIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     READ FI1 INTO RECIN AT END GO TO FIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO WS-NB-REC-LUS.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO WS-IN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-IN-LEN TO CP-LEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF CP-LEN > P-LONG
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-LONG TO CP-LEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF CP-LEN > 0
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE RECIN (1:CP-LEN) TO WS-IN (1:CP-LEN).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-IN TO WS-OUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 0 TO WS-MAJ.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 0 TO SW-ERREUR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-IN (D-POS:D-LEN) TO WS-DEV.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-DEV NOT = WS-C1 AND WS-DEV NOT = WS-C2
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        GO TO ERR-DEVISE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-DEV = WS-OWN
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        GO TO SUITE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 1 TO I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => MT-LOOP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF I > N-MT GO TO SUITE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM MT-ONE THRU MT-ONE-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO MT-LOOP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => SUITE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD WS-MAJ TO WS-NB-REC-MAJ.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-TARGET TO WS-OUT (D-POS:D-LEN).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     WRITE FO1-REC FROM WS-OUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF SW-ERREUR = 1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        ADD 1 TO WS-NB-REC-ERR
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        WRITE FO2-REC FROM WS-IN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO LECT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => ERR-DEVISE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY '*---------------------------------*'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY '*     GRAVE ERREUR DE DEVISE      *'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY '*        ABORT DU PROGRAMME       *'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY '*        CONTACTER J-Y NAUW       *'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY '*       APPELER LES POMPIERS      *'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY '*---------------------------------*'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CALL 'ABORT'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     STOP RUN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY 'NB RECORDS LUS     : ' WS-NB-REC-LUS.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY 'NB RECORDS MAJ     : ' WS-NB-REC-MAJ.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY 'NB RECORDS ERREUR  : ' WS-NB-REC-ERR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CLOSE FO2 FI1 FO1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-NB-REC-ERR > 0
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        DISPLAY '*---------------------------------*'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        DISPLAY '*     GRAVE ERREUR (OVERFLOW)     *'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        DISPLAY '*        ABORT DU PROGRAMME       *'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        DISPLAY '*        CONTACTER J-Y NAUW       *'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        DISPLAY '*       APPELER LES POMPIERS      *'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        DISPLAY '*---------------------------------*'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        CALL 'ABORT'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     STOP RUN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* amount I (skeleton CASE-0): sign form, value, convert, store
  2009-01-01 12:00  => MT-ONE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE MT-POS (I) TO FPOS.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE MT-LEN (I) TO L.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO WS-FLD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-IN (FPOS:L) TO WS-FLD (1:L).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-FLD (1:L) = SPACES GO TO MT-ONE-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-FLD (1:1) TO WS-FC.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-FLD (L:1) TO WS-LC.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 0 TO WS-NEG.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* leading separate sign: digits 2..L, WS-MAJ not set (A7)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-FC = '+' OR WS-FC = ',' OR WS-FC = '-'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 'L' TO WS-FORM
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        COMPUTE NDIG = L - 1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE ALL '0' TO WS-NUM-X
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        COMPUTE AP = 19 - NDIG
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE WS-FLD (2:NDIG) TO WS-NUM-X (AP:NDIG)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        GO TO MT-VALUE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     COMPUTE NDIG = L - 1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE ALL '0' TO WS-NUM-X.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     COMPUTE AP = 19 - NDIG.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-FLD (1:NDIG) TO WS-NUM-X (AP:NDIG).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-NUM NOT NUMERIC GO TO MT-ONE-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* trailing separate sign: digits 1..L-1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-LC = '+' OR WS-LC = ',' OR WS-LC = '-'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 'T' TO WS-FORM
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        GO TO MT-VALUE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE L TO NDIG.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE ALL '0' TO WS-NUM-X.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     COMPUTE AP = 19 - NDIG.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-FLD (1:NDIG) TO WS-NUM-X (AP:NDIG).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* unsigned: last byte a digit
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-LC NOT < '0' AND WS-LC NOT > '9'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 'U' TO WS-FORM
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        GO TO MT-VALUE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* overpunched sign on the last digit (ACOB Table 2-1)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 'S' TO WS-FORM.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 1 TO K.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => MT-OVP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF K > 10 GO TO MT-OVZ.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-LC = WS-OVP (K:1)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        COMPUTE WS-D = K - 1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE WS-D TO WS-NUM-X (18:1)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        GO TO MT-VALUE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-LC = WS-OVN (K:1)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 1 TO WS-NEG
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        COMPUTE WS-D = K - 1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE WS-D TO WS-NUM-X (18:1)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        GO TO MT-VALUE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO K.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO MT-OVP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => MT-OVZ.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-LC = '!' OR WS-LC = '?'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE '0' TO WS-NUM-X (18:1)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        IF WS-LC = '?'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>           MOVE 1 TO WS-NEG
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>           GO TO MT-VALUE
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        ELSE
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>           GO TO MT-VALUE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* any other last byte: no conversion, counted (skeleton ELSE)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 1 TO WS-MAJ.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO MT-ONE-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => MT-VALUE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-NUM NOT NUMERIC GO TO MT-ONE-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-NUM = 0 GO TO MT-ONE-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-FORM NOT = 'L'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 1 TO WS-MAJ.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-NUM TO WS-VAL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-NEG = 1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        COMPUTE WS-VAL = 0 - WS-VAL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-TARGET = 'EUR'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        DIVIDE WS-VAL BY 0,403399 GIVING WS-RES ROUNDED
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>           ON SIZE ERROR MOVE 1 TO SW-ERREUR
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>           GO TO MT-ONE-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-TARGET = 'BEF'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MULTIPLY WS-VAL BY 0,403399 GIVING WS-RES ROUNDED
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>           ON SIZE ERROR MOVE 1 TO SW-ERREUR
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>           GO TO MT-ONE-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* size error of the field itself: keep the input value
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     COMPUTE WS-LIM = 10 ** NDIG.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-RES NOT < WS-LIM OR WS-RES NOT > 0 - WS-LIM
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 1 TO SW-ERREUR
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        GO TO MT-ONE-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 0 TO WS-NEG.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-RES < 0
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 1 TO WS-NEG
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        COMPUTE WS-RES = 0 - WS-RES.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-RES TO WS-NUM.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     COMPUTE AP = 19 - NDIG.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-FORM = 'S'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE WS-NUM-X (18:1) TO WS-D
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        COMPUTE K = WS-D + 1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        IF WS-NEG = 1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>           MOVE WS-OVN (K:1) TO WS-NUM-X (18:1)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        ELSE
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>           MOVE WS-OVP (K:1) TO WS-NUM-X (18:1).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-FORM = 'L'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE WS-NUM-X (AP:NDIG) TO WS-OUT (FPOS + 1:NDIG)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ELSE
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE WS-NUM-X (AP:NDIG) TO WS-OUT (FPOS:NDIG).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => MT-ONE-EXIT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     EXIT.
</DATA>
